+### Activity Name
+
+The optional `name` field overrides the main activity title independently of
+`details` and `state`. It supports all [placeholders](#available-placeholders):
+
+```jsonc
+"name": "Working on {workspace}"
+```
+
+Omit `name` or set it to `null` to use the Discord application's registered name
+("Zed" with the default application ID). The activity type's "Playing" prefix is
+controlled by Discord and is separate from this title.
+
+Language configurations inherit the top-level `name` unless they supply their
+own value (including `null`). Workspace overrides also accept `name`; idle
+activities can set a separate `idle.name`.
+
 ### Base Icons URL
 
 The `base_icons_url` is the base URL for all language icons. This URL points to the location where the icons are stored.
